        "text": "B) Stay in my real life\n\nI'd want my relationships and my choices to actually be real, not just feel real. Even with its hardships, a life that connects me to other people and to the world as it actually is seems worth more to me than a perfectly satisfying simulation I could never check or share with anyone.",
